# S5-07 execution-observations diagnostic pair, 2026-11-15

Purpose: compare exact CPL0 RDTSC instruction sites and delivered `#PF` event
metadata across two independent counted Linux runs. These are two single-run
diagnostics, not an automatic series; no comparator was run and this evidence
does not accept S5-07.

